# Giant Growth makes Bot1's Isamaru a 5/5 until end of turn. Swift Reconfiguration then makes Isamaru a Vehicle artifact, no longer
# a creature, which has no power or toughness (CR 208.3) - but the effect that gives +3/+3 still exists and applies again the
# moment it is a creature (CR 208.3a). Disenchant destroys the Aura: Isamaru is a creature again, and a 5/5, not its printed 2/2.

